---
import WeekLayout from '../layouts/WeekLayout.astro';
import { PUBLISHED_WEEKS } from '../config/routes';
if (!PUBLISHED_WEEKS.includes(7)) return Astro.redirect('/');
---

<WeekLayout
  week={7}
  title="07"
  subtitle="The first goodbyes"
  dates="29 JUN - 5 JUL"
  primaryColor="#6C8EBF"
  accentColor="#E8B25A"
  bgColor="#eef2f7"
  prevSlug="week-06"
  prevTitle="Week 06"
  nextSlug="week-08"
  nextTitle="Week 08"
  modelPath="/models/Car.glb"
  glassContent={true}
>
  <div class="depart-flow">
  <section class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">Departures</span>
    <h2>The first goodbyes</h2>
    <p>
      Every mobility ends the same way it starts: suitcases by the door. This
      week the group finally started thinning out. One by one, people packed
      up, went around hugging everyone, and drove off home. It happened fast,
      one day someone's there at breakfast, next day their room's empty.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">Leaving behind</span>
    <h2>Empty chairs at CJ</h2>
    <p>
      The dinner table at Casa da Juventude somehow felt bigger every night,
      even though it wasn't. Seats that were loud and full last week just sat
      there empty. You don't really notice how much someone fills a room until
      they're not in it anymore.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">The road</span>
    <h2>Watching them drive off</h2>
    <p>
      Hard to watch, honestly. Especially Brandor, one of those people who
      just made everything better by being around. Going to miss them a lot.
      But it's not really goodbye, more of a "see you later." We'll cross
      paths again somewhere.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">Home</span>
    <h2>Carrying memories</h2>
    <p>
      Everyone who left took a piece of Amarante with them, and honestly, we
      hope it meant as much to them as it did to us. Weeks like this one don't
      come around twice. So instead of moping about it being over, we'd rather
      just be glad it happened.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">Photos</span>
    <h2>The week in images</h2>
    <div class="photo-grid">
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-01.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 1"></div>
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-02.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 2"></div>
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-03.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 3"></div>
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-04.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 4"></div>
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-05.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 5"></div>
      <div class="photo-item"><img src="https://uuphxemcxhlezcvehagp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Photos/week7/week07-06.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Photo 6"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
  <script>
    import '../scripts/three-week-07.ts';
  </script>

  <style>
    /* Floating side cards so the road/car/house stay visible in the centre */
    .depart-flow .content-section {
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 0 0 70vh;
    }
    .depart-flow .content-section:nth-child(odd) {
      margin-left: 4vw;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .depart-flow .content-section:nth-child(even) {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: 4vw;
    }
    /* Photos: full width, centred, normal spacing */
    .depart-flow .content-section:last-child {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 6rem auto 0;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .depart-flow .content-section,
      .depart-flow .content-section:nth-child(odd),
      .depart-flow .content-section:nth-child(even) {
        max-width: 100%;
        margin: 0 0 45vh;
      }
    }
  </style>
</WeekLayout>
